1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,669
Networks are named by the area they cover.

2
00:00:02,669 --> 00:00:08,932
A local area network covers a room, a building or a campus: fast and private.

3
00:00:08,932 --> 00:00:11,653
A metropolitan network covers a city.

4
00:00:11,653 --> 00:00:17,460
A wide area network spans a country or the world, the Internet being the biggest.

5
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:21,171
And a personal area network covers just a few metres.

